Your eepsite is ~/public_i2p, served on the I2P network at the address
in ~/.i2p-address:

  cat ~/.i2p-address

It works like your web page: index.html first, files readable by others
(chmod 644). To visit it you need I2P running on your own machine, i2pd
or the Java router both work. A new address can take a few minutes to
become reachable.

The address belongs to your account and doesn't change. If the account
is deleted, so is the address.
